{"id":"b20a58f7b40c03c4","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-analysis2-compact-embedding.md","title":"ZFC Analysis2 Compact Embedding","display":"df-zfc-analysis2-compact-embedding — ZFC Analysis2 Compact Embedding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-compact-embedding","aliases":["58-df-zfc-analysis2-compact-embedding"],"display":"df-zfc-analysis2-compact-embedding — ZFC Analysis2 Compact Embedding","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch05/58-df-normed-space]]","[[../batch06/58-df-linear-map]]","[[../batch05/58-df-compact]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-compact-embedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-analysis2-compact-embedding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-analysis2-compact-embedding — ZFC Analysis2 Compact Embedding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bdbbe5a00af04978\" href=\"?note=bdbbe5a00af04978\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-normed-space\">../batch05/58-df-normed-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-map\">../batch06/58-df-linear-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact\">../batch05/58-df-compact</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> (normed spaces over the same scalar field <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y\">\\(+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y\\)</span> (designated vector operations)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y\">\\(\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y\\)</span> (their designated norms)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in V\">\\(i\\in V\\)</span> (candidate linear map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S\\)</span> (structured normed-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bdbbe5a00af04978\" href=\"?note=bdbbe5a00af04978\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-normed-space\">../batch05/58-df-normed-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\\)</span> (fully explicit linear-map predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-map\">../batch06/58-df-linear-map</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\)</span> (compactness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact\">../batch05/58-df-compact</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_Y^{\\|\\cdot\\|}\">\\(\\tau_Y^{\\|\\cdot\\|}\\)</span> (norm topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2CompactEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2CompactEmbedding}_S\\)</span> (compact-embedding predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}compact\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}norm\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\tau_Y^{\\|\\cdot\\|}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq Y:\\forall y\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall z\\in Y\\;(\\|z-y\\|_Y&lt;\\varepsilon\\to z\\in U)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}compact\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}norm\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\tau_Y^{\\|\\cdot\\|}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq Y:\\forall y\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall z\\in Y\\;(\\|z-y\\|_Y&lt;\\varepsilon\\to z\\in U)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}compact\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\overline A^{\\,Y}\\coloneqq\\{y\\in Y:\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists a\\in A\\;(\\|y-a\\|_Y&lt;\\varepsilon)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}compact\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\overline A^{\\,Y}\\coloneqq\\{y\\in Y:\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists a\\in A\\;(\\|y-a\\|_Y&lt;\\varepsilon)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}compact\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2CompactEmbedding}_S(i;X,Y,K,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\land\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(Y,K,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\land\n\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(i,X,Y,K,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\land\n\\Bigl(\\forall x,x&#39;\\in X\\;(i(x)=i(x&#39;)\\to x=x&#39;)\\Bigr)\\land\n\\Bigl(\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\n(\\|x\\|_X&lt;\\delta\\to\\|i(x)\\|_Y&lt;\\varepsilon)\\Bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\!\\left(\\overline{i[\\{x\\in X:\\|x\\|_X\\leq1\\}]}^{\\,Y},\\{U\\cap\\overline{i[\\{x\\in X:\\|x\\|_X\\leq1\\}]}^{\\,Y}:U\\in\\tau_Y^{\\|\\cdot\\|}\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}compact\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2CompactEmbedding}_S(i;X,Y,K,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X,K,+_X,\\odot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\land\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(Y,K,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\land\n\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(i,X,Y,K,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\land\n\\Bigl(\\forall x,x&#39;\\in X\\;(i(x)=i(x&#39;)\\to x=x&#39;)\\Bigr)\\land\n\\Bigl(\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\n(\\|x\\|_X&lt;\\delta\\to\\|i(x)\\|_Y&lt;\\varepsilon)\\Bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\!\\left(\\overline{i[\\{x\\in X:\\|x\\|_X\\leq1\\}]}^{\\,Y},\\{U\\cap\\overline{i[\\{x\\in X:\\|x\\|_X\\leq1\\}]}^{\\,Y}:U\\in\\tau_Y^{\\|\\cdot\\|}\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>The norm topology, its closure operator, and the compact-embedding predicate have distinct assertion labels and no unsourced closure notation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-normed-space","status":"resolved","id":"bdbbe5a00af04978","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerp